WEBVTT

00:16:27.238 --> 00:16:30.920
Pomembno je, da se tega vsi spomnimo

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:34.754
naslednjič, ko bomo
strmeli s podivjanim srcem

00:16:34.754 --> 00:16:38.800
v tiste knjižne police.

00:16:40.254 --> 00:16:43.508
Nisem zares prepričana
kako ustvariti nove standarde

00:16:43.508 --> 00:16:45.186
za ta svet,

00:16:45.186 --> 00:16:48.270
ampak res mislim, da si

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:51.588
v naši obupni želji,
da bi ustvarili srečne otroke,

00:16:51.588 --> 00:16:54.615
zadevamo napačno moralno breme.

00:16:54.615 --> 00:16:56.333
Veliko boljši cilj se mi zdi,

00:16:56.333 --> 00:16:58.549
in upam si reči, bolj plemenit,

00:16:58.549 --> 00:17:01.268
da se osredotočimo na
vzgojo bolj produktivnih otrok